{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"potato_sack","model_identifier":"potato_sack","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## potato_sack\n\nCarried load, sack.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.5..4.5, y -6.0..6.5, z 0.0..6.2 (size 9.0 x 12.5 x 6.2 u = 25 x 35 x 18 cm).\nPotato sack: a lumpy hessian sack (potato bulges show through) with one potato on top of the tied neck. Origin = **slot_back** (middle of the back): the sack hangs on the back, its front face at z = 0 against the back, extending +Z. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 6.0.\n"},"description":"## potato_sack\n\nCarried load, sack.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.5..4.5, y -6.0..6.5, z 0.0..6.2 (size 9.0 x 12.5 x 6.2 u = 25 x 35 x 18 cm).\nPotato sack: a lumpy hessian sack (potato bulges show through) with one potato on top of the tied neck. Origin = **slot_back** (middle of the back): the sack hangs on the back, its front face at z = 0 against the back, extending +Z. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 6.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"sack","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,-6.0,0.0],"to":[4.0,4.0,6.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,8.0,10.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[16,0,22.0,10.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8,0,16.0,10.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[22,0,28.0,10.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,10,8.0,16.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[8,10,16.0,16.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"17b52de1-0bb8-5ea2-856b-c5a9230a56d3"},{"name":"slump","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission"